</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Repeated crimes awake our fears,</l><l>And Justice armed with frowns appears;</l><l>But in the Savior’s lovely face</l><l>Sweet Mercy smiles, and all is peace.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Hence, then, ye black, despairing thoughts;</l><l>Above our fears, above our faults,</l><l>His mighty intercessions rise,</l><l>And guilt recedes, and terror dies.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In every dark, distressful hour,</l><l>When sin and Satan join their power,</l><l>Let this dear hope repel the dart,</l><l>That Jesus bears us on His heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Great Advocate, almighty Friend!</l><l>On Him our humble hopes depend;</l><l>Our cause can never, never fail,</l><l>For Jesus pleads, and must prevail.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
